    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day when my parents were away, Ally, a sleeping doll, woke up! <br>I need to find clues hidden throughout the house and re-seal Ally... <br>What is true and what is false! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <br><strong>1. Find the things in the house!</strong> <br>There are 10 clues hidden in the house that are needed to seal Ally. But to keep you out of the way, Ally hid a false cue and a curse that she triggered the moment she picked it up. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001150/extras/9778ec69c33703d3ed02b69e90ccb152.avif?t=1733892112\" width=800 height=442 /></span> <br> <br><strong>2. Special paper used to seal Ally in the past</strong> <br>All the clues you acquire are recorded on this paper. You can check them anytime by pressing the [R] key. This paper has special powers, so you can decipher false clues and curses, except for true clues, by attaching them in your hand and interacting with candles in your house. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001150/extras/1a654e64e94145bda7db055cba5670b4.avif?t=1733892112\" width=800 height=430 /></span> <br> <br><strong>3. Make good use of the flashlight.</strong> <br>The flashlight has special features. Switch the lights through the keys [1], [2], and [3] to make it useful for the game. <br>[1] Light: Primary flashlight <br>[2] Blue Light: You can find traces of Ally's passing inside the house. <br>[3] Red Light: A powerful weapon that can disable Ally for a while. Look for acquisitions in the house and act to unlock that function. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001150/extras/60f6984cb2215b0db043ae71d029f045.avif?t=1733892112\" width=800 height=450 /></span> <br> <br><strong>4. Get rid of Ally!</strong> <br>Collect 10 real clues and you'll find all the information to seal Ally. <br>Find a trail of the truth and succeed in exorcising Ally by avoiding the deception of Ally!</p>",
